        "Prayag Prashasti (Allahabad Pillar Inscription) was composed in Sanskrit by Harishena, the court poet of Samudragupta.",
        "Mehrauli Iron Pillar Inscription in Delhi credits the victories of King 'Chandra', generally identified as Chandragupta II.",
